            </note>
            <note corresp="#d396-f3" n="1" xml:id="d396-f3-content">
                <p>The Minister in China reported in his telegram No. 169, April 14, 1934, 1 p.m.:
                    “Later information discloses that similar representations have not been made to
                    other Legations.” (893.113/1526)</p>
            </note>
